00:00:00,811 --> 00:00:13,096
To find arithmetic mean of several numbers we do two steps:

2
00:00:14,175 --> 00:00:21,853
Step 1: Find sum of all numbers.

3
00:00:22,884 --> 00:00:31,090
Step 2: Take sum divide by number of addends.

4
00:00:33,011 --> 00:00:47,405
Example: Find arithmetic mean of three numbers 8, 11, 14.

5
00:00:48,579 --> 00:01:01,787
So sum of 8, 11, 14 is 33.

6
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:13,448
Arithmetic mean of 8, 11, 14 is 11.

